  "id": "dev-grant-stability",
  "scope": "Finite design cut for one write-group grant. One straight-line group has one enter and one commit. The same leaf input must not both succeed and refuse. Phase 3 and phase 4 are refusals. The sealed engine has no Lean or OpenSysML provider, so the SysML source is not this receipt. No sealed GSI and no 295/300 campaign. runtimeAdmitted stays false. Ledger stays 5/12.",
